    ReferenceAuxiliaryBuilder, ReferenceAuxiliaryDocumentState, ReferenceAuxiliaryError,
    ReferenceAuxiliaryLimits, ReferenceAuxiliaryReceipt, ReferenceAuxiliaryRequest,
    ReferenceValidationReport,
